        "text": "<thinking> The task is to create a Python file named `document_client.py` in the current working directory that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for OCR and Layout Extraction. This implies the use of a specific service for OCR and Layout Extraction. Given the requirement to use a concrete third-party managed service, I will choose Amazon Textract for this purpose, as it is a well-known service for document text extraction. The code will include the necessary imports and setup for using Amazon Textract, including the configuration of the client and any helper utilities required for OCR and layout extraction tasks. </thinking>\n",
