        "text": "<thinking> To extract table cells and row structure from a document, I can use the Amazon Textract service, which is a powerful tool for extracting text and data from documents. I will write a Python script that uses the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Textract. The script will be named 'extract_tables.py' and will be created in the current working directory. </thinking>\n",
